      "content": "Feeling that your current reality is too \"empty\" to try to fix from within is a distressing sign that a deeper help is needed rather than an attempt to \"do it yourself.\"\nIf these thoughts about \"empty everything\" and \"waiting for the end\" include feelings that life has no meaning at all, please reach out to a mental health professional immediately as they can help you navigate this creative despair.\nYou deserve to feel like you belong in a world that *you* get to help build, or to find a safe space to talk about how to stop the \"ghost\" feeling.\n Please consider calling a crisis line (like 988 in the US) if these thoughts feel too heavy to carry alone today.",
